@Code
    ViewData("Title") = "Shipping, Delivery and Refund Policy of IndiaBobbles"
End Code

@section meta
    <meta name="description" content="Free shipping across India on all India Bobbles orders. Delivery times, tracking, 7-day returns, damaged items and refunds explained." />
End Section

<div class="ib-legal ib-ship container fullbody">

    <!-- Heading -->
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Shipping &amp; Returns</h1>
        <p>Everything about getting your bobblehead home safely, and what to do if something isn't right.</p>
        <span class="upd">Last updated: 8 October 2026</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Key facts -->
    <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
        <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="fact"><i class="fa fa-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Free shipping</b><span>On every order across India</span></div></div>
        <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="fact"><i class="fa fa-clock-o" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Ships in 2 days</b><span>Packed within 2 business days</span></div></div>
        <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="fact"><i class="fa fa-undo" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>7-day returns</b><span>From the date of shipment</span></div></div>
        <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="fact"><i class="fa fa-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Damage covered</b><span>Replacement or refund</span></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-3">
            <nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents">
                <h6>Contents</h6>
                <ol>
                    <li><a href="#where">Where we ship</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#timeline">Delivery times</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#tracking">Tracking your order</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#cancel">Cancelling an order</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#returns">Returns</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#how">How to return</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#damaged">Damaged or wrong items</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#refunds">Refunds</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#custom">Custom bobbleheads</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
                </ol>
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-9">
            <div class="doc">

                <h2 id="where" style="margin-top:0;">1. Where we ship</h2>
                <p>We currently ship <b>only within India</b>. Shipping is <b>free on every order</b>, with no minimum order value. We mostly ship with <b>DTDC</b>. A few remote PIN codes may not be serviceable. If yours isn't, we'll contact you before shipping and refund you in full if we can't deliver.</p>

                <h2 id="timeline">2. Delivery times</h2>
                <div class="timeline">
                    <div class="tl"><span class="dot"><i class="fa fa-shopping-cart" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><b>Order placed</b><span>You get a confirmation email</span></div>
                    <div class="tl"><span class="dot"><i class="fa fa-archive" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><b>Packed</b><span>Within 2 business days</span></div>
                    <div class="tl"><span class="dot"><i class="fa fa-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><b>Shipped</b><span>Handed to our courier</span></div>
                    <div class="tl"><span class="dot"><i class="fa fa-home" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><b>Delivered</b><span>2–3 days in metros, up to 8–10 working days elsewhere</span></div>
                </div>
                <p>Delivery times are estimates provided by our courier partners. They can vary by location and may be longer during festivals and peak seasons. Occasionally, delays happen for reasons beyond our control, such as weather, strikes or courier disruptions. We'll always help you track your parcel.</p>

                <h2 id="tracking">3. Tracking your order</h2>
                <p>Once your order ships, you can see its status and tracking details under <a href="~/orders">My Orders</a>. You can also track the parcel on the DTDC website using your tracking number. Can't find your order? <a href="#contact">Contact us</a> with your order number.</p>

                <h2 id="cancel">4. Cancelling an order</h2>
                <p>You can cancel a ready-made order free of charge <b>before it is dispatched</b>. Just contact us with your order number, and we'll refund you in full to your original payment method. Once an order has shipped, our returns policy applies.</p>

                <h2 id="returns">5. Returns</h2>
                <p>We want you to love your bobblehead. If you change your mind, you can return a ready-made item within <b>7 days from the date of shipment</b>. Returned items must be:</p>
                <ul class="checks">
                    <li><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Unused and in their original condition</li>
                    <li><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> In their original packaging</li>
                    <li><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Complete with all tags, instructions and inserts</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="note-box"><i class="fa fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>Not returnable:</b> custom bobbleheads, because they are made just for you, unless they arrive damaged or defective.</p>

                <h2 id="how">6. How to return an item</h2>
                <ol class="steps">
                    <li><b>Tell us first.</b> Email <a href="mailto:indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com?subject=Return%20request">indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com</a> with your order number and the item you're returning.</li>
                    <li><b>Pack it safely</b> in the original packaging. Bobbleheads are fragile, so add extra padding.</li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Send it to:</b>
                        <address class="addr">
                            India Bobbles<br />
                            H104, Ajnara Daffodil<br />
                            Sector 137, Noida<br />
                            Uttar Pradesh – 201305, India
                        </address>
                    </li>
                    <li><b>Keep your receipt and tracking number.</b> You pay the return shipping cost, and items lost in return transit can't be credited.</li>
                </ol>

                <h2 id="damaged">7. Damaged or wrong items</h2>
                <p>We pack every piece carefully, but if your bobblehead arrives damaged, we'll make it right:</p>
                <ol class="steps">
                    <li><b>Take clear photos</b> of the damaged item and the packaging. An unboxing video helps a lot.</li>
                    <li><b>Email them within 4 hours of delivery</b> to <a href="mailto:indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com?subject=Damaged%20item">indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com</a>, with your order number.</li>
                    <li>We'll send you a <b>replacement</b> or give you a <b>refund</b> (excluding shipping cost).</li>
                </ol>
                <p>Received the wrong item, or found a manufacturing defect? Contact us and we'll replace it or refund you in full.</p>

                <h2 id="refunds">8. Refunds</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Returns (change of mind):</b> refunded as <b>store credit</b> for the purchase price, excluding taxes and shipping, within <b>72 business hours</b> of receiving your return.</li>
                    <li><b>Cancelled before dispatch, or undeliverable:</b> full refund to your original payment method.</li>
                    <li><b>Damaged, defective or wrong item:</b> a replacement, or a refund to your original payment method.</li>
                    <li>Bank refunds usually reach your account within 5–7 working days after we process them, depending on your bank.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2 id="custom">9. Custom bobbleheads</h2>
                <p>Custom pieces are made to order, so the timeline is confirmed in your quote, plus the delivery times above. They can't be returned or cancelled once work has started, but our damage policy fully applies. See <a href="~/order-custom-bobbleheads">Custom Bobbleheads</a> for details.</p>

                <h2 id="contact">10. Contact us</h2>
                <div class="contact-box d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <p class="mb-1"><b>Questions about shipping or returns?</b></p>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            <i class="fa fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="mailto:indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com">indiabobbles@rudrasofttech.com</a><br />
                            <i class="fa fa-clock-o" aria-hidden="true"></i> Monday–Saturday, 10:00 AM–6:00 PM IST
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <a class="btn btn-help" href="https://indiabobbles.tawk.help" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa fa-question-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Visit Help Centre</a>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mt-3 mb-0">See also our <a href="~/terms-and-conditions">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and <a href="~/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. Nothing in this policy affects your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>